 ## Phase 4 — Mapping
 
 * `robotics_mapping`: log-odds `OccupancyGrid` with hand-crafted inverse model and
-  Bresenham/supercover integration, entropy (Ch. 13); exact EDT/ESDF and 2-D TSDF (Ch. 19).
